+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Electric model review</title><style>body{background:#172129;color:#edf1f3;font:16px/1.5 system-ui;max-width:1500px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 20px}h1,h2{line-height:1.2}.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}figure{margin:0}img{width:100%;height:auto}figcaption{padding:8px;background:#24333e}a{color:#dbe9f0}li{margin:20px 0}@media(max-width:700px){.pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style><h1>Electric model review / 2026-10-25</h1><p>Current production models, matched camera poses and studio setup. Visual review only. Both renderers pass 34 technical checks. The electric model still needs finishing work to meet the Compact comparison.</p><ol><li><b>P1: Primary body joins remain too sharp for the requested Compact-level finish</b><p>The nose/fender and hood/front transitions form abrupt, slab-like lighting breaks in matched native views. Separate side, hood and front skin patches meet without a shared rolled corner profile. The Compact has more developed edge transitions.</p></li><li><b>P2: Rear-door lower seam is visibly unfinished</b><p>The rear-door bottom outline starts at Z=0.405, while the existing vertical seam is at Z=0.26. The rear door has no corresponding leading closure because that branch runs only for the front door. This leaves an obvious break in the panel outline. Seams are raised 5mm bars over intact paint.</p></li><li><b>P2: Rear plate well and lamp housing lack formed recess depth</b><p>RoundedTail remains an uninterrupted painted skin. PlateWell is placed 0.005 model units outward, RearOpticalHousing 0.006 outward; fascia adds relief to rear_z. These are surface overlays rather than formed pockets, which leaves the rear looking flat beside the Compact.</p></li></ol><p>Full 154,276 / simpler 55,700 triangles. No phone performance or appearance acceptance is inferred from these desktop captures. The existing top diagnostic pose clips the longer car and is excluded from this comparison; no production camera was changed.</p><h2>Compatibility / front</h2><div class="pair"><figure><figcaption>Compact / front</figcaption><a href="model/compact-front.png"><img src="model/compact-front.png" alt="compact front"></a></figure><figure><figcaption>Electric / front</figcaption><a href="model/electric-front.png"><img src="model/electric-front.png" alt="electric front"></a></figure></div><h2>Compatibility / rear</h2><div class="pair"><figure><figcaption>Compact / rear</figcaption><a href="model/compact-rear.png"><img src="model/compact-rear.png" alt="compact rear"></a></figure><figure><figcaption>Electric / rear</figcaption><a href="model/electric-rear.png"><img src="model/electric-rear.png" alt="electric rear"></a></figure></div><h2>Compatibility / side</h2><div class="pair"><figure><figcaption>Compact / side</figcaption><a href="model/compact-side.png"><img src="model/compact-side.png" alt="compact side"></a></figure><figure><figcaption>Electric / side</figcaption><a href="model/electric-side.png"><img src="model/electric-side.png" alt="electric side"></a></figure></div><h2>Compatibility / optics</h2><div class="pair"><figure><figcaption>Compact / optics</figcaption><a href="model/compact-optics.png"><img src="model/compact-optics.png" alt="compact optics"></a></figure><figure><figcaption>Electric / optics</figcaption><a href="model/electric-optics.png"><img src="model/electric-optics.png" alt="electric optics"></a></figure></div><h2>Compatibility / wheel</h2><div class="pair"><figure><figcaption>Compact / wheel</figcaption><a href="model/compact-wheel.png"><img src="model/compact-wheel.png" alt="compact wheel"></a></figure><figure><figcaption>Electric / wheel</figcaption><a href="model/electric-wheel.png"><img src="model/electric-wheel.png" alt="electric wheel"></a></figure></div><h2>Desktop Mobile / Vulkan / front</h2><div class="pair"><figure><figcaption>Compact / front</figcaption><a href="mobile-model/compact-front.png"><img src="mobile-model/compact-front.png" alt="compact front"></a></figure><figure><figcaption>Electric / front</figcaption><a href="mobile-model/electric-front.png"><img src="mobile-model/electric-front.png" alt="electric front"></a></figure></div><h2>Desktop Mobile / Vulkan / rear</h2><div class="pair"><figure><figcaption>Compact / rear</figcaption><a href="mobile-model/compact-rear.png"><img src="mobile-model/compact-rear.png" alt="compact rear"></a></figure><figure><figcaption>Electric / rear</figcaption><a href="mobile-model/electric-rear.png"><img src="mobile-model/electric-rear.png" alt="electric rear"></a></figure></div><h2>Desktop Mobile / Vulkan / side</h2><div class="pair"><figure><figcaption>Compact / side</figcaption><a href="mobile-model/compact-side.png"><img src="mobile-model/compact-side.png" alt="compact side"></a></figure><figure><figcaption>Electric / side</figcaption><a href="mobile-model/electric-side.png"><img src="mobile-model/electric-side.png" alt="electric side"></a></figure></div><h2>Desktop Mobile / Vulkan / optics</h2><div class="pair"><figure><figcaption>Compact / optics</figcaption><a href="mobile-model/compact-optics.png"><img src="mobile-model/compact-optics.png" alt="compact optics"></a></figure><figure><figcaption>Electric / optics</figcaption><a href="mobile-model/electric-optics.png"><img src="mobile-model/electric-optics.png" alt="electric optics"></a></figure></div><h2>Desktop Mobile / Vulkan / wheel</h2><div class="pair"><figure><figcaption>Compact / wheel</figcaption><a href="mobile-model/compact-wheel.png"><img src="mobile-model/compact-wheel.png" alt="compact wheel"></a></figure><figure><figcaption>Electric / wheel</figcaption><a href="mobile-model/electric-wheel.png"><img src="mobile-model/electric-wheel.png" alt="electric wheel"></a></figure></div></html>
